  612|  6.59k|      // regions, not as an absolute offset in the visible frame.  The
  613|  6.59k|      // Tile's own offset is added to this in order to address into
  614|  6.59k|      // the input Frame.
  615|  6.59k|      let tile_sbo = TileSuperBlockOffset(SuperBlockOffset { x: fbx, y: fby });
