  368|   101M|    //  state, we compute the worst-case number of bits of val that must be
  369|   101M|    //  encoded to ensure that the value is inside the range for any possible
  370|   101M|    //  subsequent bits.
  371|   101M|    // The computation here is independent of val itself (the decoder does not
  372|   101M|    //  even track that value), even though the real number of bits used after
  373|   101M|    //  od_ec_enc_done() may be 1 smaller if rng is a power of two and the
  374|   101M|    //  corresponding trailing bits of val are all zeros.
